OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRather cloudy during the
OL,6,Fmorning, with rain spreading
OL,7,Fsoutheast, occasionally heavy at
OL,8,Ffirst. Then turning drier and brighter
OL,9,Finto the afternoon with just a few
OL,10,Flight showers. Fresh winds easing.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,13,Fevening with some sunny spells. Cloud
OL,14,Fand outbreaks of rain then spread in
OL,15,Ffrom the west during the early hours.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FMainly cloudy with rain in the
OL,18,Fmorning, turning more showery in the
OL,19,Fafternoon with some bright or sunny
OL,20,Fspells developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
